Subject: [PATCH 13/45] inkling2: tf-inkling2-engine drafted, fixed-depth
 drafted greedy against plain greedy

Each window is the pending token plus a 7-draft block, verified in one 8-row
window with the agreeing rows kept, eager and graphed; an oracle arm drafts
plain greedy's own next tokens with one spoiled per window, so every kept count
from 1 to 8 runs. Two comments shortened for the lean check.
---
 zig/src/families/inkling2/engine_main.zig | 52 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 52 insertions(+)

